{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced","id":1451767,"title":"Second Inquisition Book Announced","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-11T16:09:09-07:00","id":1451767,"title":"Second Inquisition Book Announced","content":"coming this Fall. It has been announced on Renegade's Twitch<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-kftzvkkgjv/product_images/uploaded_images/vamp-book-nod-web-banner-1140x441-preorder-1-.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/\" target=\"_blank\"> Announcing four new products for Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition! </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Test Today as part of our Elysium: Weekend of Darkness activities we're announcing four new products for Vampire: The Masquerade Roleplaying Game 5th Edition that you can expect to see in stores later this year. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 06-11-2021, 07:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T16:32:06-07:00","id":1451771,"title":"","content":"I hope they use the opportunity to introduce the Technocracy to V5. I think to stay relevant as a threat and therefore as an effective ST tool the second inquisition needs to have &quot;tiers of power&quot;, low level military goons for neonates, top of the top secret agents and religious types armed with true faith (please re-introduce inquisition powers btw) for ancillae games and awakened agents with supertech weapons for elders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T16:46:50-07:00","id":1451774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haquim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451771#post1451771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope they use the opportunity to introduce the Technocracy to V5. I think to stay relevant as a threat and therefore as an effective ST tool the second inquisition needs to have &quot;tiers of power&quot;, low level military goons for neonates, top of the top secret agents and religious types armed with true faith (please re-introduce inquisition powers btw) for ancillae games and awakened agents with supertech weapons for elders.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I sincerely hope they don't. To me, that would undermine the core conceit of 'humans are a fucking threat to vampires'. Society of Leopold and other church organizations, organizations like Firstlight, and maybe mystical groups like what the Arcanum became are enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T17:22:55-07:00","id":1451777,"title":"","content":"I too would like, &quot;Yes, humans are entirely capable of destroying vampiredom. However, admittedly, part of it is because vampires are the worst and wouldn't lift a finger to save 90% of their race.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T18:10:09-07:00","id":1451783,"title":"","content":"Hopefully they take the opportunity to course correct the depiction of the UK SI in FoL.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T18:28:14-07:00","id":1451785,"title":"","content":"I hope there's at least a passing mention of the Imbued Hunters, if only to give me hope of a HTR 2nd Edition or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26871-uncritical","name":"UnCritical","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26871_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T19:04:45-07:00","id":1451790,"title":"","content":"I know one of Paradox's stated goals is to have a singular World of Darkness, so Mage the Ascension (and the Technocracy) would have a presence in VtM. And the Technocracy secretly pulling the strings behind by the Second Inquisition (both providing material assets as well as pushing members of various governments to work together) would go a long way to making the Second Inquisition make more sense than it currently does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T19:12:56-07:00","id":1451792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451783#post1451783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hopefully they take the opportunity to course correct the depiction of the UK SI in FoL.</div> </div> </div> </div>The retcon for THE FALL OF LONDON was both helpful and disappointing.<br /> <br /> IT WAS MITHRAS ALL ALONG!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/P8u8md-NiHM\" data-code=\"P8u8md-NiHM\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/P8u8md-NiHM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> I mean, it made sense of a lot of confusing stuff, but it also made the SI look like a bunch of chumps. &quot;Vampires are behind it!&quot; has also been hinted for Vienna and Venice.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451790#post1451790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know one of Paradox's stated goals is to have a singular World of Darkness, so Mage the Ascension (and the Technocracy) would have a presence in VtM. And the Technocracy secretly pulling the strings behind by the Second Inquisition (both providing material assets as well as pushing members of various governments to work together) would go a long way to making the Second Inquisition make more sense than it currently does.</div> </div> </div> </div>It would also eliminate the Second Inquisition as a concept wouldn't it? It's just another arm of the Union then and another sign Humanity can't do shit.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I'd prefer they retconned Ravnos being taken down by the Second Inquisition or government to the Union.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T22:08:42-07:00","id":1451802,"title":"","content":"The Second Inquisition doesn't make any sense as it's been presented. My player who's in the military had this to say about them. (I've shared this before.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I also think it\u2019s pretty hilarious the idea that they\u2019re trading information across countries. This is the single biggest point of contention in the real, less _darkness_ world. None of the spy bosses want to share anything. The military doesn\u2019t play nice with the spies. The countries don\u2019t play nice with each other.<br /> <br /> Some perspective here, for instance, US ships can\u2019t even do most of our comms with other NATO ships using 10-20 year old systems because we refuse to share our crypto, even when we have better more advanced systems available as well that we could keep to ourselves. The US military intelligence couldn\u2019t share info on the 9/11 terrorists with the civilian side, and even in the years since it\u2019s gotten almost no better.<br /> <br /> Yet I\u2019m supposed to believe that the top secret guys at the top are sharing secrets and intel on their most terrifying new threats (i.e. undead monsters with mind control powers) with each other? When they might be compromised? Hell, even when there isn\u2019t that threat, it\u2019s almost impossible to share info in the real world, much less in the World of Darkness. This is a game of corrupt power, of corruption at the top, of secrecy and greed and hunger for power. International partnerships and sharing information is\u2026 not really in the cards.<br /> <br /> The annihilation of Vienna is particularly laughable to me. You cannot move and organize the number of men and materials needed to wage that kind of massive battle without leaving a hilariously massive paper trail - and trail of bureaucrats and money behind. </div> </div> </div>Mind, I don't think it's necessary to have the SI be puppets of the Technocracy to make them out as a credible threat. The modern-day surveillance state has plenty of tools to make unlife miserable for vampires. But I don't see a plausible explanation for how so many different organizations so rife with (justified) paranoia are working together besides &quot;the Technocracy is pulling strings.&quot;<br /> <br /> All the same, looking forward to the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":3110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","user":"False Epiphany","date":". 06-12-2021, 01:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T23:11:32-07:00","id":1451805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>False Epiphany</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451802#post1451802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Second Inquisition doesn't make any sense as it's been presented. My player who's in the military had this to say about them. (I've shared this before.)<br /> <br /> Mind, I don't think it's necessary to have the SI be puppets of the Technocracy to make them out as a credible threat. The modern-day surveillance state has plenty of tools to make unlife miserable for vampires. But I don't see a plausible explanation for how so many different organizations so rife with (justified) paranoia are working together besides &quot;the Technocracy is pulling strings.&quot;<br /> <br /> All the same, looking forward to the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>My hope is they will establish they aren't working together but are just generally facing the same direction. It would make a lot more interesting storyline to have them have their own internal strife and interscine warfare.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T23:11:35-07:00","id":1451806,"title":"","content":"Give me the Imbued! They can be in addition to the SI, or they can infiltrate it, or they can be coopted by the Technocracy, but I want to see the Hunters again in some shape or form.<br /> <br /> I am willing to wait until after M5, W5, C5 and Wr5 are all published, however. But that may take a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 06-13-2021, 05:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T00:16:49-07:00","id":1451808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451792#post1451792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would also eliminate the Second Inquisition as a concept wouldn't it? It's just another arm of the Union then and another sign Humanity can't do shit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess that depends on whether you consider members of the Technocracy to be humans or not. <br /> <br /> Honestly I don't think it would change a whole lot. Some of the more egregious examples, such as the attack on the Tremere Chantry in Vienna might turn out to have had some HIT-marks and other Enlightened scientists who used magic to get through the Tremere's magical defenses and whatnot, but most of what the Second Inquisition has been doing is largely possible by humans without any magical capability.<br /> <br /> It's also worth pointing out that the Technocracy was experimenting with supernatural hunting field agents back with Strike Force Zero (which were deemed a success back then), and it only makes sense when it comes to laying siege to vampire compounds that you would have groups like that, using advanced technology, out on the front lines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T07:11:13-07:00","id":1451845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>False Epiphany</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451802#post1451802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Second Inquisition doesn't make any sense as it's been presented. My player who's in the military had this to say about them. (I've shared this before.)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Mind, I don't think it's necessary to have the SI be puppets of the Technocracy to make them out as a credible threat. The modern-day surveillance state has plenty of tools to make unlife miserable for vampires. But I don't see a plausible explanation for how so many different organizations so rife with (justified) paranoia are working together besides &quot;the Technocracy is pulling strings.&quot;<br /> <br /> All the same, looking forward to the book.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, because Vampire has FOREVER been mired in things being 100% actual to the real world setups and methodologies of things like businesses and government organizations!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T07:27:36-07:00","id":1451847,"title":"","content":"I could believe that discovering that there are non-human monsters infiltrating society and eating humans would goose intelligence agencies into sharing more info. A very powerful common enemy tend to bring out the cooperation aspect in humans.<br /> <br /> Fall of Vienna I think only makes sense if Tremere was behind it. Saulot taking over his clan, all the diablerized Salubri chewing their way through Tremere souls like dragons teeth. Tremere acting to deny the clan to Saulot. The idea of the one step blood bound to the council was probably put there by Saulot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T07:50:11-07:00","id":1451852,"title":"","content":"I like when real military spies share info about how fiction spies should be depicted (irony).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24202-justycar","name":"Justycar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24202_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T11:21:44-07:00","id":1451881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trollroot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451847#post1451847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could believe that discovering that there are non-human monsters infiltrating society and eating humans would goose intelligence agencies into sharing more info. A very powerful common enemy tend to bring out the cooperation aspect in humans.<br /> <br /> Fall of Vienna I think only makes sense if Tremere was behind it. Saulot taking over his clan, all the diablerized Salubri chewing their way through Tremere souls like dragons teeth. Tremere acting to deny the clan to Saulot. The idea of the one step blood bound to the council was probably put there by Saulot.</div> </div> </div> </div>My only issue there is that it seems to be that the SI keep getting their victories attributed to vampires.<br /> <br /> London only happened before of Mithras.<br /> <br /> Venice because of the Harbingers.<br /> <br /> OTOH, there's never NOT going to be vampires betraying each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T11:33:12-07:00","id":1451886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451845#post1451845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, because Vampire has FOREVER been mired in things being 100% actual to the real world setups and methodologies of things like businesses and government organizations!</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm less concerned with whether it is real than whether it feels real.<br /> <br /> I mean, if we want to talk realism, the earth shouln't be able to sustain a vampiric population the size of VtM's (or even a vastly smaller one) without getting completely depopulated of humans. An academic study was done into that. But I'm okay there. It's like faster than light travel in sci-fi. The science might say it can't be real, but it feels real enough that I can suspend my disbelief.<br /> <br /> I don't need to be a spy IRL to know the SI's member organizations are displaying a ton of trust towards one another, and that there are a billion and one mundane and supernatural ways their people could be compromised. If this were a primarily action-driven setting, I could swallow it, but the World of Darkness is a political intrigue setting that turns the paranoia dial up to 11. And... the writers haven't done that here. They've turned it way down. It feels like depicting steamy sex in Harry Potter or moral ambiguity in Star Wars. It's inconsistent with the setting's tone.<br /> <br /> Moreover, unlike &quot;a large vampire population can coexist hidden among humanity,&quot; it's not <i>necessary</i>. The Second Inquisition is perfectly capable of being a threat to vampires without its member organizations being such good buddy-buds. It works better as a label for a larger trend of intelligence agencies/militaries/et al independently seeing through the Masquerade, and hunters in general getting more dangerous, than it does as an international alliance of hunter/government organizations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T12:01:59-07:00","id":1451889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Justycar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451852#post1451852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like when real military spies share info about how fiction spies should be depicted</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, given the setting itself told us for years how these various groups operated, and it matched with how real-world spies and militaries and countries operated, I find the comparison rather relevant.<br /> <br /> Because the SAD, the Society of Leopold, etc had all been previously portrayed as paranoid groups. Much like real world spy groups are. And unlike spies, who if they're compromised there's usually some kind of paper trail to back it up, these supernatural investigators have to worry about actual shape-shifters, mind control, spirits watching them, and far more. Seeing these groups suddenly being all like &quot;nah, it's fine, Joe Bob over there might have been dealing with vampires and ghosts for ten years, but I'm sure not a one of them put a brain worm in his head!&quot; and sharing their intel in any way is far more jarring than finding out the FSB and CIA directors share all their files over tea would be.<br /> <br /> I don't like it when fictional spies who know Big Brother isn't the only one watching them and the guy they're about to talk to could be a secret agent for Dracula's secret cousin, act like that suddenly stopped being the case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T14:57:29-07:00","id":1451914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451881#post1451881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My only issue there is that it seems to be that the SI keep getting their victories attributed to vampires.<br /> <br /> London only happened before of Mithras.<br /> <br /> Venice because of the Harbingers.<br /> <br /> OTOH, there's never NOT going to be vampires betraying each other.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see your point. But for me the SIs ramping that fast up to things like the Fall of London and Vienna, as well as keeping it secret -well to me it totally destroys the settings internal plausibility and ruins my suspension of disbelief. Yes, vampires etc. But the thing is, when you introduce fantastic elements like vampires, you need to keep you internal consistency even tighter than in a normal story,<br /> <br /> And it is hardly out of character for vampires to try to manipulate the Inquisition to go after their enemies even as the flames rage.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T16:03:09-07:00","id":1451920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trollroot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451847#post1451847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could believe that discovering that there are non-human monsters infiltrating society and eating humans would goose intelligence agencies into sharing more info. A very powerful common enemy tend to bring out the cooperation aspect in humans.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would have actually imagined the opposite happening. While, as an intelligence agent in your own country, you might be reasonably certain that the vampiric menace hasn't infiltrated your own government, how can you be certain that the vampires haven't infiltrated the foreign government that you're working with, and that their intelligence agency isn't simply a pawn of the vampires? Especially once the general nature of the Camarilla, as a world-wide conspiracy that has its hooks in any governments across the world comes to light, I would have imagined government agencies getting more paranoid.<br /> <br /> For me, it only starts to make sense once you have another global conspiracy pushing people from different countries, who have very strong reasons to be paranoid and untrusting, to work together to combat the other global conspiracy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T16:19:44-07:00","id":1451922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451920#post1451920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would have actually imagined the opposite happening. While, as an intelligence agent in your own country, you might be reasonably certain that the vampiric menace hasn't infiltrated your own government, how can you be certain that the vampires haven't infiltrated the foreign government that you're working with, and that their intelligence agency isn't simply a pawn of the vampires? Especially once the general nature of the Camarilla, as a world-wide conspiracy that has its hooks in any governments across the world comes to light, I would have imagined government agencies getting more paranoid.<br /> <br /> For me, it only starts to make sense once you have another global conspiracy pushing people from different countries, who have very strong reasons to be paranoid and untrusting, to work together to combat the other global conspiracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to put too fine a point on it but isn't that exactly what happened? Except the global conspiracy was the CAMARILLA not the Technocracy. The Camarilla book explained that they're the ones who started using the intelligence agencies against the Sabbat and Anarchs as a form of control but their pawns rebelled them started targeting them.<br /> <br /> There's a certain level of <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/HistoryRepeats\" target=\"_blank\">History Repeats</a> here that is deliberate.<br /> <br /> Goratrix and the Lasombra tried to manipulate the Church into destroying their enemies, only to result in the Church rising up against them then slaughtering half the vampires of Europe.<br /> <br /> This is the same situation almost exactly except it's intelligence assets instead of Christianity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T16:59:28-07:00","id":1451924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451792#post1451792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> It would also eliminate the Second Inquisition as a concept wouldn't it? It's just another arm of the Union then and another sign Humanity can't do shit.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I'd prefer they retconned Ravnos being taken down by the Second Inquisition or government to the Union.</div> </div> </div> </div>It makes perfect sense for the Union to have started the Second Inquisition only to lose interest after the fall of Vienna. So the SI should be a creation of the Technocracy left largely independent of the Technocracy itself (until the threat level of ematovores is considered high enough that the Union needs to send agents in).<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T17:08:20-07:00","id":1451926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451922#post1451922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Goratrix and the Lasombra tried to manipulate the Church into destroying their enemies, only to result in the Church rising up against them then slaughtering half the vampires of Europe.<br /> <br /> This is the same situation almost exactly except it's intelligence assets instead of Christianity.</div> </div> </div> </div>The medieval Catholic Church isn't a modern-day coalition of assorted intelligence agencies and hunter organizations, though.<br /> <br /> The First Inquisition was largely carried out by the Catholic Church, which was a single organization whose members hailed from a culture where shared faith and belief in the supernatural further bound them together. The Inquisition was formed under the pope's orders and operated under his orders. Vampires pointed the Inquisition at their enemies, let it destroy them, then realized they'd fucked up when it started destroying them too.<br /> <br /> The Second Inquisition is a panoply of disparate organizations who have none of that, and an internal culture that massively discourages inter-organizational trust and cooperation. There is no pope telling everyone to work together, or individual incentive to work together. Or even Kindred incentive to work together. <i>&quot;The Camarilla pointed the intelligence agencies at its enemies.&quot;</i> Okay. So what does this actually involve? Probably vampires leaking information about other vampires to the intelligence agencies/hunter orgs and letting them take care of the rest. Vampires aren't actually trying to assemble a larger alliance among those guys. Why would they do that? It's damn hard, risks tipping their hand, and in of itself, doesn't actually destroy any enemies.<br /> <br /> I can buy vampires trying to use the SI's member organizations as catspaws, and it later backfiring, but I don't see how that would have encouraged a bunch of paranoiacs to work together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T17:45:59-07:00","id":1451929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haquim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451924#post1451924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It makes perfect sense for the Union to have started the Second Inquisition only to lose interest after the fall of Vienna. So the SI should be a creation of the Technocracy left largely independent of the Technocracy itself (until the threat level of ematovores is considered high enough that the Union needs to send agents in).</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it makes more sense that humans aren't idiots and this is an outgrowth of Project: Twilight.<br /> <br /> But I admit, I'm biased and quite liked the SAD and NSA sections of said book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T18:40:51-07:00","id":1451933,"title":"","content":"Cooperation between security services isn't unusual. There was a lot of cooperation in the global war on terrorism, the coalition against ISIS, etc. There are long term ongoing security agreements between the US, UK, Canada, Australia and New Zealand. NATO works together. There's an international effort against Somali piracy. These things aren't smoothly running Tom Clancy style competence pornography but realistically everyone is in a Coen Brothers movie and nobody is Jack Ryan, including the vampires.<br /> <br /> The only unrealistic thing about SI in this regard are the scope of the cooperation; it's apparently truly global, and not broken by existing international conflicts or travelling along existing alliances. It would be more realistic for there to be multiple Inquisitions of varying capability based around existing security agreements. The FSB is uncooperative with the CIA, for example, but the CIA and the BND work together all the time. I think it would be interesting if the book brought factional and internal division to the SI to reflect this. <br /> <br /> The other unrealistic thing would be the secrecy of it; an organization and campaign of global scope would be damned hard to hide, even if you were disguising it as counter-terrorism. But the secrecy of supernatural conspiracies in the World of Darkness is a genre conceit. You couldn't realistically hide the Camarilla, either; the urban fantasy/horror genre just sort of shrugs because it's the cost of doing business in a world both familiar and unnatural.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":543,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","user":"Professor Phobos","date":". 06-12-2021, 09:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T20:55:09-07:00","id":1451938,"title":"","content":"I guess my thought is that, at the end of the day, if the Technocracy exists, then there's no reason why they <i>wouldn't</i> have a hand in the Second Inquisition. The whole thing is absolutely right up their alley. In fact, it would be a really weird if they <i>weren't</i> working with the Second Inquisition, smoothing things over between different agencies, providing information and material assets when possible, pulling political strings when necessary, etc.<br /> <br /> Also consider that one of the ideas for the Technocracy was that they had previously felt vampires didn't pose a major threat to humanity and since they had their Masquerade, the Technocracy figured they could leave vampires alone (at least until they had sufficient control over reality that they could crush them). However after Ravnos' awakening and the Week of Nightmares, the danger level of vampires skyrocketed and the Technocracy felt that they could no longer leave them alone, and decided to start making more overt moves against vampires.<br /> <br /> So something like the Second Inquisition was sort of already telegraphed, at least in prior editions of MtA. And then with 5th edition, the designers have always been clear that one of their goals is to have a unified, &quot;one World of Darkness&quot; so the Technocracy presumably exists in the setting.<br /> <br /> So for me, it's feels like it's obvious that the Technocracy is behind the Second Inquisition, and even if the SI isn't the Technocracy's puppet or anything, the Technocracy would still hugely influential to the point where if there's something that doesn't make a whole lot of sense on the surface (and there's a few things involving the SI that come across that way), then &quot;The Technocracy did it,&quot; or &quot;The Technocracy caused it to happen,&quot; strikes me as an entirely reasonable answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 06-12-2021, 11:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T21:07:29-07:00","id":1451939,"title":"","content":"On the flip side, what if it's the holy war aspect that's the common thread, and all the myriad agencies aren't deliberately working together or sharing information, but rather having their disparate efforts guided toward their targets via divine inspiration (or at least the equivalent in the form of the Messengers)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T21:36:06-07:00","id":1451943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451922#post1451922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is the same situation almost exactly except it's intelligence assets instead of Christianity.</div> </div> </div> </div>But that's a pretty big difference.<br /> <br /> The medieval church was greater than a nation. Rome often dictated who would be king, which nation could war with which, so on and so forth. Inquisition-era Christianity would be more akin to a single, unified intelligence agency. Seeing the Church cooperate with, well, the church itself isn't at all jarring. The top guys in the church would have good reasons to trust one another, and when you throw in True Faith and stuff, they can also be relatively (not completely) certain who is &quot;on the take&quot; and who isn't, at least among that upper echelon.<br /> <br /> This isn't a single, unified group who got &quot;in on the secret&quot;, if you will. This is multiple, disparate groups. They wouldn't all be able to call on a higher up with True Faith or some similar ability to see if the agent from the other group is under some whammy. They don't have a unifying belief system. They don't even all agree on what the supernatural threat even is. This has all been established lore.<br /> <br /> It'd be more like if back during the OG Inquisition, the Christian church started suddenly working with Muslims, Jews, and Bhuddists, and shared everything with them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T00:43:11-07:00","id":1451959,"title":"","content":"Huh, apparently this book will be Antagonist SPC only as well. I'm not sure I understand cutting out large swathes of the fandom that like playing Hunters Hunted and similar games ( but then I don't really understand cutting out the near 50% of VtM fans that play Sabbat games either.)<br /> <br /> I guess they've done their research but it seems a missed opportunity to me, everyone loves Vampire Hunters in media.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T02:23:41-07:00","id":1451964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451959#post1451959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh, apparently this book will be Antagonist SPC only as well. I'm not sure I understand cutting out large swathes of the fandom that like playing Hunters Hunted and similar games ( but then I don't really understand cutting out the near 50% of VtM fans that play Sabbat games either.)<br /> <br /> I guess they've done their research but it seems a missed opportunity to me, everyone loves Vampire Hunters in media.</div> </div> </div> </div>It makes sense to me as a Vampire: The Masquerade supplement rather than a new gameline.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451938#post1451938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess my thought is that, at the end of the day, if the Technocracy exists, then there's no reason why they <i>wouldn't</i> have a hand in the Second Inquisition. The whole thing is absolutely right up their alley. In fact, it would be a really weird if they <i>weren't</i> working with the Second Inquisition, smoothing things over between different agencies, providing information and material assets when possible, pulling political strings when necessary, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the Technocracy is kind of a shadow of its former self and not engaged in the Pogrom anymore as of Revised let alone T20.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T11:58:39-07:00","id":1452028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Justycar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451852#post1451852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like when real military spies share info about how fiction spies should be depicted (irony).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As above so below; even in fiction, if something comes across as &quot;fair&quot; you're less likely to dislike it, even if a joke is somewhat at your expense. If something's bullshit and has no justification for why it's bullshit, even in a fantastical setting, you're more likely to find it objectionable, even if it's a biography that shows you in a favourable light. The more you know about something, the more you care, so if you just want people who know nothing about how things work to enjoy your media, your attitude is fine, but if you actually want most people to like your product, some level of empathy and accuracy is required. When people horrendously screw up a depiction of something you're into, you'll be upset, so don't act like ignorance is bliss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T14:11:38-07:00","id":1452061,"title":"","content":"1st, I had hoped to be a writer on an SI book. That didn't happen but there are no hard feelings - best wishes to everyone involved in the book. I will likely get it when it is released.<br /> <br /> 2nd, the SI is no more unlikely and no more unworkable than anything else in the WoD. If the Camarilla, Sabbat and Anarch shenanigans can pass a smell test, then do can the SI. It is all working or rules of story and what works for a narrative anyway, and nothing so relentless as a rational world.<br /> <br /> 3rd, all of this is strictly voluntary in any case. There is nothing to require anyone include the SI in any VtM game. I like the concept because it is a way to challenge the players and to reiterate the existence of vampires is both evil and precarious. It is a thematic element that works perfectly well in the setting. I can't help but notice a lot f players are protesting something which even tacitly might possibly inhibit their PCs for doing whatever the fuck they want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T15:21:11-07:00","id":1452080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451920#post1451920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would have actually imagined the opposite happening. While, as an intelligence agent in your own country, you might be reasonably certain that the vampiric menace hasn't infiltrated your own government, how can you be certain that the vampires haven't infiltrated the foreign government that you're working with, and that their intelligence agency isn't simply a pawn of the vampires? Especially once the general nature of the Camarilla, as a world-wide conspiracy that has its hooks in any governments across the world comes to light, I would have imagined government agencies getting more paranoid.<br /> <br /> For me, it only starts to make sense once you have another global conspiracy pushing people from different countries, who have very strong reasons to be paranoid and untrusting, to work together to combat the other global conspiracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Valid point, but I can see a process by which it might happen: If the intelligence agencies started out with little information on the capabilities of vampires. Non-humans passing for human but they show up on IR, etc. Might be aliens or something. They start lobbing warnings to allied nations organizations, many of the work pretty well together. Some get intercepted by rival nations agencies, they thing its misdirection but to a check -oh shit!<br /> <br /> Then they start pooling information, and the &quot;<i>oh shit we lost apex predator status</i>&quot; factor skyrockets as they start to realize what vampires are actually capable of, even only the younger and more socially active. Mind-control, shape-changing etc. But by then they are already in the old human &quot;<i>huddle around the fire pointing flint-tipped spears at the darkness together</i>&quot; mode.<br /> <br /> If they manage to take out a few neonates, they'll get confidence that their detection methods work.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T18:14:19-07:00","id":1452099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451964#post1451964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It makes sense to me as a Vampire: The Masquerade supplement rather than a new gameline.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>*Looks back at the entire history of HH books and affliated organisations being supplements for other gamelines with quizzical expression.*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T19:43:34-07:00","id":1452104,"title":"","content":"Well, put me down for hoping the Technocratic Union has nothing to do with the SI for the simple reason that M5 is clearly nowhere on the drawing board and I\u2019d want all those mechanics and story decisions fully hammered out before they move into cross-splat territory.<br /> <br /> That said, I\u2019m going with Tremere organized the destruction of the Vienna Chantry to end the threat of the White Worm and it\u2019s puppets, but all the behind the scenes manipulations and favor calling ended up with an organization that was too effective and wasn\u2019t going to stop with Vienna.<br /> <br /> Basically, Tremere got them over the hurdle of initial cooperation, but couldn\u2019t turn the spigot off afterwards because the upper echelon\u2019s realized they could use the vampire threat as a means of exerting more secret control over and funding from various other government bodies.<br /> <br /> Instead of exposing or removing the congressmen, senators, judges, etc. who are vampire pawns they\u2019re instead blackmailing them to get more resources fed to them via various black ops appropriations... only a fraction of which goes for operations, the rest is lining the pockets of upper management and greasing the palms various other politicians and bureaucrats.<br /> <br /> Related to that is that, outside of the Society of St. Leopold and various other fundamentalists, the SI isn\u2019t actually intended in wiping out vampires; if they solved the problem their funding would dry up. Instead they just want to \u201ccontain\u201d the problem and throw a major operation that\u2019s more flash than substance whenever funding renewals are about to come up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T21:36:03-07:00","id":1452108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1451964#post1451964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the Technocracy is kind of a shadow of its former self and not engaged in the Pogrom anymore as of Revised let alone T20.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if the Technocracy is a shadow of its former self, I have a hard time imagining that they are entirely unaware of the Second Inquisition. Further, if they are aware of it, I have a harder time imagining that they would actively choose to stay out and do absolutely nothing. Even if they aren't providing manpower or logistics they would be providing information, helping to bridge intelligence agencies in different countries, etc.<br /> <br /> It seems like such an obvious thing that when (if) we get a 5th ed Mage, I have no doubt that it would retcon the Second Inquisition into having had some form of Technocratic assistance from get-go. Otherwise you'd need an explanation as to why the Technocracy chose to refrain from assisting the Second Inquisition in any way whatsoever despite being the best possible place to do so. And I've never been a fan of retcons so I'd prefer to just see the Technocracy be given a role now, hopefully a small one, rather than get retconned into the Second Inquisition later. <br /> <br /> Of course all of that rests on some assumptions. First, it assumes that Paradox is still interested in their singular &quot;One World of Darkness.&quot; It's possible they've changed their minds on that, and will have things go back to where ech game has their own setting and those settings occasionally bump into one another. Second it also assumes that we'll be getting a v5 Mage the Ascension at some point. It's possible Paradox isn't interested in producing that game and so the Technocracy nor anything else in Mage will ever play a role in the setting. And finally it assumes that the Technocracy as a group still exists and hasn't been entirely destroyed (though that would fundamentally change the basic gameplay and concept behind Mage if there is no Big Brother watching you).<br /> <br /> Now if it were up to me, I'd have kept each gameline as their own setting with no real crossovers so we wouldn't even be having this conversation. But as long as we have One World of Darkness, and as long as the Technocracy exists coterminously alongside Vampire, then the Technocracy would, and should, have some role in the Second Inquisition, though ideally a fairly small one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 06-14-2021, 12:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-13T22:49:34-07:00","id":1452114,"title":"","content":"I'd have the Technocrats be reluctant to aid such groups, because despite superficial similarities they are ultimately enemies. The Technocracy is a conspiracy of Mages who create genetically engineered and cybernetic monsters. They are really not the natural allies of guys who are largely working class FBI types and significantly Christian. The Technos need to be cautious about letting them have too much power or information. While it would be harder for a Technocrat to be caught than a vampire or werewolf, they also need to be perpetually cautious of being caught since they are often working in the same building as the people who could catch them. The inquisition has come for scientists before, and those scientists weren't genuinely part of a conspiracy to control everyone while creating sci-fi abominations in laboratories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T00:09:21-07:00","id":1452122,"title":"","content":"<b>Pros of using the Technocracy</b><br /> -HIT Mark Vs are cool<br /> -Energy weapons are cool<br /> -MIB are cool. <br /> -They could reasonably co-ordinate security agencies without too much concern for vampires Dominating them to the point of compromise. <br /> <b>Cons of Technocracy. </b><br /> -Players will be wanting to use those energy weapons. V5 is very much over invested with it's &quot;personal horror&quot; nonsense, and some fun romps fighting MiB and the Terminator will completely upend that. <br /> -The Technocracy don't have the resources, and while vampires suck at battles, they excel at wars. The Technocracy can't reasonably take on vampires when they've got the traditions, nephandi, disparates, internal power struggles and so on to worry about. <br /> -Technocrat leaders are smart AF so I don't see how they'd agree to this. <br /> <br /> <b>Pros of it literally just being humans.</b> <br /> -persecution complexes are fun for vampires.<br /> - stresses that &quot;masquerade&quot; thing<br /> <b>Cons of just being humans</b><br /> -Basically every human with power benefits from the status quo vampires bring and nothing is more upsetting than a big reshuffle. Carrot will be answered with Carrot and stick will be answered with stick, so why take stick? <br /> -There's no way agencies can trust eachother, nevermind small factions of different agencies, nevermind that some of these organizations (SoL) would be considered terrorist organizations. <br /> -There's no way agencies can be connected enough without compromise since vamps are very good at finding weak links and following the chain. <br /> -would not stand up to v20 disciplines<br /> <br /> <b>Pros of it being an elder conspiracy</b><br /> -It's logistically viable<br /> -Gehenna/Anarch fears are a good motivation. <br /> -Works thematically. <br /> <b>Cons of it being an elder conspiracy</b><br /> Way too obvious with the Camarilla shrinking. You're just asking for the anarchs to kill your princes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T01:12:12-07:00","id":1452130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452122#post1452122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Pros of using the Technocracy</b><br /> -HIT Mark Vs are cool<br /> -Energy weapons are cool<br /> -MIB are cool.<br /> -They could reasonably co-ordinate security agencies without too much concern for vampires Dominating them to the point of compromise.<br /> <b>Cons of Technocracy. </b><br /> -Players will be wanting to use those energy weapons. V5 is very much over invested with it's &quot;personal horror&quot; nonsense, and some fun romps fighting MiB and the Terminator will completely upend that.<br /> -The Technocracy don't have the resources, and while vampires suck at battles, they excel at wars. The Technocracy can't reasonably take on vampires when they've got the traditions, nephandi, disparates, internal power struggles and so on to worry about.<br /> -Technocrat leaders are smart AF so I don't see how they'd agree to this.<br /> <br /> <b>Pros of it literally just being humans.</b><br /> -persecution complexes are fun for vampires.<br /> - stresses that &quot;masquerade&quot; thing<br /> <b>Cons of just being humans</b><br /> -Basically every human with power benefits from the status quo vampires bring and nothing is more upsetting than a big reshuffle. Carrot will be answered with Carrot and stick will be answered with stick, so why take stick?<br /> -There's no way agencies can trust eachother, nevermind small factions of different agencies, nevermind that some of these organizations (SoL) would be considered terrorist organizations.<br /> -There's no way agencies can be connected enough without compromise since vamps are very good at finding weak links and following the chain.<br /> -would not stand up to v20 disciplines</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Pros of using the Imbued</b><br /> -The Imbuing gives humans of any status reason to fight the vampires.<br /> -They have the powers necessary to stand up to disciplines<br /> -Hunters-net gives them a way to organize meetings and attacks without being immediately compromised by vampires.<br /> -The seeming lack of any sort of unified front denies the vampires an easy target that they can fight against. In other words, they can't turn things from a series of battles into a proper war.<br /> <b>Cons of using the Imbued</b><br /> -They lack proper organization<br /> -Getting resources and, more importantly, distributing them is a major challenge<br /> -Even if the government and vampires can't figure out what's going on, any large-scale, overt actions are pretty quickly going to be branded as terrorism.<br /> <br /> My recommendation, just use all of them. The SI isn't one unified force but rather various organizations that aren't exactly friends, aren't always talking to each other, and might not even realize that each other exist in some cases, but whose mutual hatred of vampires sees them pointed in the same general direction nonetheless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26871-uncritical","name":"UnCritical","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26871_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T06:25:34-07:00","id":1452154,"title":"","content":"Have the Imbued been mentioned in V5 at all? I don't foresee them being reintroduced, at least not until the classic five (Werewolf, Mage, Changeling, Wraith) are back in the mix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T08:24:52-07:00","id":1452166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452114#post1452114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd have the Technocrats be reluctant to aid such groups, because despite superficial similarities they are ultimately enemies. The Technocracy is a conspiracy of Mages who create genetically engineered and cybernetic monsters. They are really not the natural allies of guys who are largely working class FBI types and significantly Christian. The Technos need to be cautious about letting them have too much power or information. While it would be harder for a Technocrat to be caught than a vampire or werewolf, they also need to be perpetually cautious of being caught since they are often working in the same building as the people who could catch them. The inquisition has come for scientists before, and those scientists weren't genuinely part of a conspiracy to control everyone while creating sci-fi abominations in laboratories.</div> </div> </div> </div>Making cybernetic and genetic monsters is really something only a small minority of the Technocracy does. Even in Iteration X and the Progenitors, making monsters isn't something they're all hellbent on doing. And certainly when you're looking at the Syndicate or New World Order or the Void Engineers, there's not a lot of monster making to be had. It'd be kind of like looking at the Sabbat and saying they're big into making monsters because the most prominent Clan does that, but even among the Tzimisci, creating monsters isn't all that common or universal.<br /> <br /> I just can't see a group like New World Order say, &quot;You know what? We're witnessing the largest, most organized pogrom of reality deviants that's happened in several hundred centuries with actors and agencies from across the world coming together, and we have influence, knowledge and power but... we're just gonna sit out and twiddle our thumbs and do nothing and hope nothing bad happens, nothing goes wrong, and cross our fingers that the Sleepers don't end up finding out the truth.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T09:50:43-07:00","id":1452177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452114#post1452114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They are really not the natural allies of guys who are largely working class FBI types and significantly Christian.</div> </div> </div> </div>In what universe is the FBI &quot;working class?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T12:42:44-07:00","id":1452202,"title":"","content":"It's a very political term that means different things in different contexts. Eh, if you go by marxist definitions, lawyers and doctors are working class, because they work for a living. You leave the working class once you work out how to make money without working. In some places, only manual labourers are considered working class, and a retail worker who makes less money than them is considered &quot;lower middle class&quot; or something rediculous like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 06-14-2021, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T13:26:52-07:00","id":1452216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>False Epiphany</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452177#post1452177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In what universe is the FBI &quot;working class?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they are very much the type of group that would be used by the Union.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T14:27:56-07:00","id":1452233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452166#post1452166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Making cybernetic and genetic monsters is really something only a small minority of the Technocracy does. Even in Iteration X and the Progenitors, making monsters isn't something they're all hellbent on doing. And certainly when you're looking at the Syndicate or New World Order or the Void Engineers, there's not a lot of monster making to be had. It'd be kind of like looking at the Sabbat and saying they're big into making monsters because the most prominent Clan does that, but even among the Tzimisci, creating monsters isn't all that common or universal.<br /> <br /> I just can't see a group like New World Order say, &quot;You know what? We're witnessing the largest, most organized pogrom of reality deviants that's happened in several hundred centuries with actors and agencies from across the world coming together, and we have influence, knowledge and power but... we're just gonna sit out and twiddle our thumbs and do nothing and hope nothing bad happens, nothing goes wrong, and cross our fingers that the Sleepers don't end up finding out the truth.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You're thinking of the NWO as if it's an all powerful monolith. Think of it instead in terms of actual agents who have cautiously infiltrated various groups. That NWO guy is completely surrounded by paranoid mundanes, most of whom are very traditional rightwingers who believe in God and America. They are not the friends of a conspiracy of atheists who consider America just another meaningless set of borders to be ruled from behind the scenes by their worldwide cabal. To them, a Technocrat is just an uncanny valley enemy, one just close enough to their own methodology to be utterly terrifying. A Technocrat has to be super-cautious when infiltrating such a group. They can't really afford to be just spewing out information. Where did they get that information? Why is Bob so astonishingly more in-the-know than everyone else? We know these freaks scheme against each other. Is Bob an infiltrator from one of these groups? Let's all study Bob waaayyyy more closely than he is comfortable with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 06-14-2021, 05:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T16:36:55-07:00","id":1452253,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452233#post1452233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're thinking of the NWO as if it's an all powerful monolith. Think of it instead in terms of actual agents who have cautiously infiltrated various groups. That NWO guy is completely surrounded by paranoid mundanes, most of whom are very traditional rightwingers who believe in God and America. They are not the friends of a conspiracy of atheists who consider America just another meaningless set of borders to be ruled from behind the scenes by their worldwide cabal. To them, a Technocrat is just an uncanny valley enemy, one just close enough to their own methodology to be utterly terrifying. A Technocrat has to be super-cautious when infiltrating such a group. They can't really afford to be just spewing out information. Where did they get that information? Why is Bob so astonishingly more in-the-know than everyone else? We know these freaks scheme against each other. Is Bob an infiltrator from one of these groups? Let's all study Bob waaayyyy more closely than he is comfortable with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ironically, I have more difficulty believing the NWO would be able to work together than the various intelligence agencies. Remember the NWO is a bunch of lunatics who have their own delusions of what will be a utopian society.<br /> <br /> Communists, Fascists, Nationalists, and...worse.<br /> <br /> ACADEMICS.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T18:28:15-07:00","id":1452260,"title":"","content":"The SI is a cultural phenomena among secret societies, so there should be room in it for both the imbued and the Technocracy. I don't know enough about the imbued to speak to them, aside from saying there should be room for them in the SI. In terms of the Technocracy, it would work best if it is support and influence on the down low. The Syndicate helping to keep the money flowing (in part by embezzling from vampires), the NWO helping with weapons procurement, NWO helping with information and organization. But the SI is not a Technocracy project, just one they think of as a good idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T19:44:45-07:00","id":1452269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452233#post1452233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're thinking of the NWO as if it's an all powerful monolith. Think of it instead in terms of actual agents who have cautiously infiltrated various groups. That NWO guy is completely surrounded by paranoid mundanes, most of whom are very traditional rightwingers who believe in God and America. They are not the friends of a conspiracy of atheists who consider America just another meaningless set of borders to be ruled from behind the scenes by their worldwide cabal. To them, a Technocrat is just an uncanny valley enemy, one just close enough to their own methodology to be utterly terrifying. A Technocrat has to be super-cautious when infiltrating such a group. They can't really afford to be just spewing out information. Where did they get that information? Why is Bob so astonishingly more in-the-know than everyone else? We know these freaks scheme against each other. Is Bob an infiltrator from one of these groups? Let's all study Bob waaayyyy more closely than he is comfortable with.</div> </div> </div> </div>An FBI agent, someone's who's spent years in the FBI as a field agent or whatever, is probably not going to be an actual Technocrat. They're probably going to be a Sleeper Agent who knows more about what's going on than most, or maybe an Extraordinary Citizen (someone with Hedge magic). But it's unlikely that an actual Technocrat would be putting their Enlightened Life to the side to engage in personal, long-term infiltration like that when there are other people who could do that instead. While the Technocracy isn't an all-powerful monolith, it does have a hierarchy and lots of players and a command structure that is much more powerful than what you see in say, Vampiric Clans or the Traditions.<br /> <br /> Also, keep in mind we're not talking about small, cadre of rogue intelligence officers. We're talking about a group that is capable of causing the USA to drop blockbuster bombs on a major European capitol and then covering it all up. That's not something that a small cabal can pull off, that's something that's only going to happen if numerous major players in the CIA and the US military are in on it. And when the conspiracy gets that large, it's more and more likely that you'll see the Technocracy getting involved, simply because the Technocracy has a lot of resources invested in intelligence agencies and the like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-14T21:28:14-07:00","id":1452275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1452269#post1452269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> An FBI agent, someone's who's spent years in the FBI as a field agent or whatever, is probably not going to be an actual Technocrat. They're probably going to be a Sleeper Agent who knows more about what's going on than most, or maybe an Extraordinary Citizen (someone with Hedge magic). But it's unlikely that an actual Technocrat would be putting their Enlightened Life to the side to engage in personal, long-term infiltration like that when there are other people who could do that instead. While the Technocracy isn't an all-powerful monolith, it does have a hierarchy and lots of players and a command structure that is much more powerful than what you see in say, Vampiric Clans or the Traditions.<br /> <br /> Also, keep in mind we're not talking about small, cadre of rogue intelligence officers. We're talking about a group that is capable of causing the USA to drop blockbuster bombs on a major European capitol and then covering it all up. That's not something that a small cabal can pull off, that's something that's only going to happen if numerous major players in the CIA and the US military are in on it. And when the conspiracy gets that large, it's more and more likely that you'll see the Technocracy getting involved, simply because the Technocracy has a lot of resources invested in intelligence agencies and the like.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is just my impression from the books but generally True Mages are much-much rarer than vampires but they are often the heads of large numbers of organizations and the Technocracy have fairly huge numbers of slaves/servants/allies.<br /> <br /> An NWO agent is not going to be an FBI SAD agent but they had one of their Unenlightened Personnel as Sub-Director of the entire thing. Felicity Price isn't even aware she's working for the Technocracy. She thinks she's working for the NSA, which has a bunch of NWO satellite organizations inside it that think they're secret organizations within the NSA (because they are) but the real power.<br /> <br /> Which is to say that the Technocratic Union is the Man Behind the Man Behind the Man.<br /> <br /> In the Marvel Universe, the Technocracy wouldn't be SHIELD. They'd be the guys who cut SHIELD their checks. Same for the SI. They'd be the guys who kitted them out and made it easier for them to operate but wouldn't be the boots on the ground or even their leadership. I'd have an NWO agent spend 5 minutes with their leader and Mind 3 fuck them to say, &quot;You know, you don't want to reveal vampires to the public. You want to exterminate them secretly.<span style=\"color:#1D1C1D\"><span style=\"font-family:Slack-Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Otherwise, onward, atheist soldier. Have at it.&quot;</span></span></span> <div align=\"left\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D1C1D\"><span style=\"font-family:Slack-Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Technocracy in the old days had a frigging Dyson Sphere. The Illuminati and Hydra are just their accountants. Its why I always felt Pentex's greatest threat was the Syndicate and why they HAD to be cool with them. Because Pentex may be the top 30 corporations in the world and eliminating them would destroy Western civilization.<br /> <br /> HOWEVER, The Syndicate can ALTER THE CONCEPT OF CAPITALISM.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> They are a whole different paradigm of war.</div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-15-2021, 03:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-15T00:19:36-07:00","id":1452286,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that's really what I was thinking. The Technocracy would mostly be underwriting and funding some of the Second Inquisition's actions as well as providing information (at east to those groups they felt could be trusted to some extent) and otherwise just pulling strings and manipulating information to keep the more blatant actions quiet and to prevent various groups (non-affiliated government agencies, the media, etc) from investigating.<br /> <br /> So the Technocracy would be tangentially involved with the Second Inquisition, but they wouldn't be directly involved short of Gonzo-tier events like Ravnos' awakening where pretty much anything goes. But they would definitely be doing something behind the scenes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 06-15-2021, 10:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-16T17:39:08-07:00","id":1452562,"title":"","content":"&quot;Who benefits from the Second Inquisition and its ripple effects&quot; is probably more important than whether splat ABC or XYZ could pull the Inquisition off.<br /> <br /> Just going with the assumption that the realignment of the Anarchs, the Camarilla, and the Lasombra to restore the old medieval distinction between High and Low Clans was an intended effect, I wouldn't be shocked or let down if the initial spark came from a particularly old and conservative good ol' boys club within the Friends of the Night using their connections in the Catholic Church.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-16T18:52:32-07:00","id":1452569,"title":"","content":"Can someone post a hyperlink to the panel discussion where the writers discuss the Second Inquisition book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-25T14:46:20-07:00","id":1453485,"title":"","content":"Now I admit my understanding of 5th is still limited since I haven't been as active in reading WoD material lately, but my impression of the SI has always been that the term reflects humanity's greater awareness of Vampires (if not the supernatural) in general and the challenges that creates for Vampires to operate and thrive in secrecy. It's not an open war (except maybe wherever the Beckoning is happening) and it may not even be a cold war. At most its maybe more like counter-insurgency (which is mostly intel and small unit stuff against terrorists, which you could kind of see Vampires being treated as.) And even then there's not really much of a concerted, unified effort. There's a broader awareness and willingness to cooperate - especially if middle men exist to facilitate communications between various groups - but by and large each nation/state has its own approach to tackling the Supernatural (or possibly several that don't cooperate like the US.) It's a bit like early HtR - you had individuals and even small groups that might be tied together by shared identity/creed or goals shared over Hunter-net but they were far from a unified monolithic entity (pretty sure 5th has even made it clear the SI isn't and shouldn't be treated like a monolithic entity. A singular, unified effort is what you need for a conventional war but small unit stuff is a different matter logistically and militarily and I'm not sure we'll ever see MBTs and howitzers turned against vampires in any coordinated manner. Vampires aren't dumb enough to engage in direct warfare like that after all.) <br /> <br /> Basically they're a bit like the Hellsing universe's 'paranormal' organizations (groups that largely have defined 'turf' they oversee that other factions don't intrude on) or the BPRD from Hellboy (if you want a more 'international' flavor without the boundaries) and all the complexities and feuding potential that can bring. I'd also see the Technocracy as one of those 'middlemen' seeking to facilitate coordination (without necessarily controlling the entire thing - it's not like they don't have a huge number of other challenges and threats on their plate that they can afford to exclusively focus on Vampires, especially if the vampires aren't making themselves an existential threat that *requires* a higher priority yet.) I'd also see Rome and the Vatican (and factions like the Society of Leopold and allied groups) also acting as intermediaries between different groups. Both factions would have a vested interest in bringing together the disparate groups under a single, unified banner since that would greatly improve their ability to eradicate vampires, but that doesn't make it easy to do by any means (as others have noted there's paranoia and distrust in such echelons and even without that we know that vampires infiltrate intel agencies like any other governmental body which is a further such challenge to unification efforts) I'd also see supernatural 'multinational' corporations - something like Pentex or Shinzui industries (in some ways this also overlaps with the Technocracy too for that matter.) A megacorp - especially with the rise of PMCs and the like - could just as easily imitate a political state without necessarily having all the handicaps of that state (again think Pentex, but devoted to hunting Vampires.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25533-mister_dunpeal","name":"Mister_Dunpeal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-25T16:21:00-07:00","id":1453490,"title":"","content":"I took the Second Inquisition to be an attempt to update the setting to a post-War on Terror world when massive government surveillance and paramilitary operations have become a defacto part of life.<br /> <br /> You need to explain how the Masquerade holds in an area of smart phones and drone strikes.<br /> <br /> The answer: IT HASN'T.<br /> <br /> But the people who know about vampires now are helping cover it up while prosecuting their own war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T06:28:11-07:00","id":1453543,"title":"","content":"Honestly, Disciplines like Dominate and Presence (not to mention the Dementation amalgams) should allow vampires to find at least someone in the SI to manipulate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T11:23:02-07:00","id":1453570,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453543#post1453543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, Disciplines like Dominate and Presence (not to mention the Dementation amalgams) should allow vampires to find at least someone in the SI to manipulate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is why they have the Inquisition-Inquisition that has hedge magic, psychic powers, and so on.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I thought the point of the Camarilla's fuck up was that they DID have people doing this behind the scenes but they tipped their hand too much.<br /> <br /> You CAN manipulate the Second Inquisition to protect yourself but don't try and do it to the entire organization.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-27T09:25:14-07:00","id":1453653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453543#post1453543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, Disciplines like Dominate and Presence (not to mention the Dementation amalgams) should allow vampires to find at least someone in the SI to manipulate.</div> </div> </div> </div>They probably can. But given that there are a lot of different groups involved in the SI, it is unlikely anyone with Dominate and Presence (not to mention the Dementation amalgams) can manipulate much of the SI and doing that to most or all of the SI is probably impossible. In the USA the SI involves something like three groups, none of which answer to a singular group or person. And all the participating nations have their own SI factions. So even if some vampire took over the FBI's involvement in the SI, that would not give them power over the CIA's involvement and they would not have power of the British SI or the German SI and so on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-28T04:08:25-07:00","id":1453689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453653#post1453653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They probably can. But given that there are a lot of different groups involved in the SI, it is unlikely anyone with Dominate and Presence (not to mention the Dementation amalgams) can manipulate much of the SI and doing that to most or all of the SI is probably impossible. In the USA the SI involves something like three groups, none of which answer to a singular group or person. And all the participating nations have their own SI factions. So even if some vampire took over the FBI's involvement in the SI, that would not give them power over the CIA's involvement and they would not have power of the British SI or the German SI and so on.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a good thing there aren't many elders around. If there were, I'd count on at least one of them developing a 'Dominate an entire network of organisations' as a high-level power (maybe as a combo-Discipline).<br /> <br /> Perhaps that's what Tremere already did...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-28T06:41:54-07:00","id":1453694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453689#post1453689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a good thing there aren't many elders around. If there were, I'd count on at least one of them developing a 'Dominate an entire network of organisations' as a high-level power (maybe as a combo-Discipline).<br /> <br /> Perhaps that's what Tremere already did...</div> </div> </div> </div>One thing to note that is canon is the fact Felicity Price was their long term Dominated agent of the NSA. But her Elder was either Beckoned or killed.<br /> <br /> So she was suddenly free-willed and PISSED.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-28T09:45:21-07:00","id":1453698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453694#post1453694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One thing to note that is canon is the fact Felicity Price was their long term Dominated agent of the NSA. But her Elder was either Beckoned or killed.<br /> <br /> So she was suddenly free-willed and PISSED.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is why you leave an emergency contacts list when you leave town.<br /> <br /> &quot;In case a former slave gains independence, call this number...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-28T10:04:08-07:00","id":1453700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453698#post1453698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is why you leave an emergency contacts list when you leave town.<br /> <br /> &quot;In case a former slave gains independence, call this number...&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That is an element I would like to see examined. The big issue isn't so much that the Camarilla COULDN'T handle this but it wasn't exactly prepared for a sudden mass disappearance of Elders as so much of their power base is due to permanently positioned immortals of vast personal power.<br /> <br /> When a Koch brother dies, he leaves a will.<br /> <br /> Not so much Valderax the Undying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-29T13:08:02-07:00","id":1453784,"title":"","content":"I'm currently debating the whole &quot;omnicience&quot; of the Second Inquisition in my game. I plan to include them, but have them lurking and stuff. It's a return to sources I guess, haven't played or STed a V:TM game in years. There is alot of stuff to get caught up with <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-29T16:43:22-07:00","id":1453802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453784#post1453784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm currently debating the whole &quot;omnicience&quot; of the Second Inquisition in my game. I plan to include them, but have them lurking and stuff. It's a return to sources I guess, haven't played or STed a V:TM game in years. There is alot of stuff to get caught up with <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If I were to canonize my impression:<br /> <br /> * The Second Inquisition is viewed by some Elders as omniscient and omnipresent<br /> <br /> * The Second Inquisition is, in reality, a completely divided mess that usually only gets stragglers and what other vampires set up.<br /> <br /> * Other vampires set up a LOT of other vampires.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-29T21:14:35-07:00","id":1453810,"title":"","content":"So, in terms of life imitating art I feel the need to share. I\u2019m running V20 with players who are completely unfamiliar with the V5 metaplot. I introduced the destruction of the Vienna Chantry and the notion that human hunters might have brought it down.<br /> <br /> Tonight, one of the PC\u2019s, an elder in the city was extremely upset that a rival vampire (a Sabbat pack they\u2019d been hoping to take down in neighboring city to claim their territory as their own) had the mortal they were looking to make their new ghou murdered as part of the Sabbat sending a message to stay out of their affairs.<br /> <br /> The idea they finally fixated on for revenge was to... leak rumors of the Sabbat\u2019s location to the Inquisition.<br /> <br /> So, without prompting, a PC elder decided to do the exact thing V5 said happened with the Elders and the Second Inquisition... trying to manipulate it into a weapon against their enemies while believing they won\u2019t get burned by the backlash.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s almost funny if it weren\u2019t going to so hideously blow up my campaign in the process. It\u2019ll be a glorious mess, but also a lot of work to figure out the fallout.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-30T06:14:41-07:00","id":1453838,"title":"","content":"I can see the inquisition torturing some Sabbat member for information an extracting the location of the PC's haven in the process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-30T07:32:49-07:00","id":1453844,"title":"","content":"I mean, our PCs use the Second Inquisition as well.<br /> <br /> Why?<br /> <br /> Because the only thing vampires hate more than Hunters is other vampires.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-30T11:50:39-07:00","id":1453857,"title":"","content":"The Mortician's Army makes a all-out military assault in WINTER'S TEETH 9# that's out today.<br /> <br /> Helicopters, tactical gear, and so on.<br /> <br /> They are also INCREDIBLY STUPID in how they do it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-30-2021, 02:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-30T13:39:03-07:00","id":1453861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453838#post1453838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see the inquisition torturing some Sabbat member for information an extracting the location of the PC's haven in the process.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or just being floated the info as counter-intelligence without the capture/torture angle. I'm dubious about most forms of torture being able to extract information unwillingly from vampires who play demolition derby with burning cars for fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-30T18:07:47-07:00","id":1453881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451767-second-inquisition-book-announced?p=1453861#post1453861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or just being floated the info as counter-intelligence without the capture/torture angle. I'm dubious about most forms of torture being able to extract information unwillingly from vampires who play demolition derby with burning cars for fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the problems with the vinculum is that when your buddies are getting brutally tortured and inching closer and closer to Final Death, you're a bit more likely to spill your guts or do whatever you can to try and protect them. It's not quite as extreme as torturing the vampire someone is Blood Bound to, but it can still be a fairly effective way of getting Sabbat vampires to spill their guts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","va